WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000 line:0
Five-card stud: each player antes 10, then gets
one hidden card and one up card.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000 line:0
North’s A♥ beats East’s K♥, so North acts first.
The best up cards act first each round.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:17.000 line:0
North clicks Bet, enters 40 and confirms.
The first player may check or bet.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:20.500 line:0
Fast-forward: East calls 40; the next up card
is dealt only after each betting round.

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:25.999 line:0
North’s A♥ A♣ make a pair and act first;
both players check.

00:00:25.999 --> 00:00:33.249 line:0
The fourth up card is out.
North clicks Bet and bets 100.

00:00:33.249 --> 00:00:36.999 line:0
East calls 100 and the fifth card is dealt:
each player has one hidden and four up cards.

00:00:36.999 --> 00:00:45.999 line:0
Last round: North clicks Bet, chooses All-in
and puts in the remaining 850.

00:00:45.999 --> 00:00:49.499 line:0
East calls all-in and betting ends.

00:00:49.499 --> 00:00:56.998 line:0
Showdown: North’s three aces beat
East’s pair of kings and win the pot.

00:00:56.998 --> 00:01:06.000 line:0
North has 2,000 chips, East none: the match ends.
Otherwise 20 hands are played and chips decide.
